WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.051 --> 00:00:07.491
What the IHRU, the housing institute,
is doing in the neighbourhood: last week,

2
00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:15.575
they came to demolish some
houses that weren't finished,

3
00:00:16.021 --> 00:00:17.432
and some fencing.

4
00:00:17.762 --> 00:00:20.080
And also, in the last few days,

5
00:00:20.164 --> 00:00:27.725
news has been coming out that they're
coming to fence off the neighbourhood,

6
00:00:27.809 --> 00:00:29.600
to fence off the whole neighbourhood.

7
00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:34.670
That's the news going around.

8
00:00:34.754 --> 00:00:39.334
And they even say, in Parliament,
the head of the IHRU says —

9
00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:44.832
I was there watching
the debate with the mayor —,

10
00:00:45.283 --> 00:00:49.776
they say they're working
on enclosing the neighbourhood.

11
00:00:49.986 --> 00:00:54.820
I don't know what the reason
is for fencing it off.

12
00:00:55.130 --> 00:01:00.431
Whether it's just
fencing off the empty plots,

13
00:01:00.515 --> 00:01:07.730
so there's no more building,
or fencing in the neighbourhood itself.

14
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.360
I don't know that,
it's just news going around.

15
00:01:13.504 --> 00:01:17.477
Fencing off the neighbourhood
is something that can't happen,

16
00:01:17.768 --> 00:01:21.360
because those who live here are people,
they're human beings.

17
00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:27.022
There are many children, elderly people,
people with health problems,

18
00:01:27.112 --> 00:01:29.769
lots of young people, working people,

19
00:01:29.853 --> 00:01:34.190
who go out every morning to work,
who pay taxes.

20
00:01:34.274 --> 00:01:42.087
We live here in a situation that isn't
pleasant, because we don't have water,

21
00:01:42.177 --> 00:01:47.530
we don't have electricity,
we don't have sewers, we don't have post,

22
00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:51.751
we don't have anything here.
We live isolated.

23
00:01:51.835 --> 00:01:56.648
We're close to everything here,
here in Almada, but we live isolated.

24
00:01:56.738 --> 00:02:01.937
That can't happen,
because to fence us in, decent people

25
00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.772
who have no housing to live in...

26
00:02:04.922 --> 00:02:06.913
We came to live here

27
00:02:07.024 --> 00:02:12.123
because the wages here in Portugal aren't
enough to pay for a house, they're not.

28
00:02:12.207 --> 00:02:14.944
They know very well it's
not enough to do anything.

29
00:02:15.028 --> 00:02:18.086
If they come and enclose
the neighbourhood, that's terrible.

30
00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:24.572
We feel we're being
treated like an animal,

31
00:02:24.656 --> 00:02:27.275
like an animal or like an inmate.

32
00:02:27.359 --> 00:02:30.017
We're decent people, working people.

33
00:02:30.101 --> 00:02:37.220
We can't live cornered like this.
It's like we're prisoners or animals.

34
00:02:37.848 --> 00:02:39.820
That can't happen.
